---
import Base from '@/layouts/Base.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '@/components/Breadcrumbs.astro';

const crumbs = [{ label: 'Home', href: '/' }, { label: 'Care & support' }];
const topics = [
  ['Cleaning', 'Approved cleaning guidance for your model and timber.'],
  ['Timber maintenance', 'How to look after the exterior and interior timber.'],
  ['Ventilation', 'Approved guidance for your configuration.'],
  ['Heater care', 'Guidance from the heater manufacturer for the heater you have.'],
  ['Periods of non-use', 'What to do if the sauna is not used for a while.'],
];
---
<Base
  title="Outdoor Sauna Care & Support | Alder & Ember"
  description="How aftercare works with Alder & Ember: a first point of contact after handover, care guidance for your model, and warranty information once approved."
  breadcrumbs={crumbs}
>
  <header class="page-head container">
    <Breadcrumbs items={crumbs} />
    <h1>Care &amp; support</h1>
    <p class="lead">After handover you have an accessible first point of contact for care questions and problems.</p>
  </header>

  <section class="section section--flush-top" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
    <div class="container grid-12">
      <div class="c-4">
        <p class="label muted">Who to ask</p>
        <h2 id="contact-title">Your first point of contact</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="c-7 c-start-6 prose">
        <p>We give you contact details for aftercare at handover. If something is not right, start there, and we will either help directly or point you to the equipment manufacturer.</p>
        <div class="alert alert--info" role="note">
          <h3>Contact channels are not yet published</h3>
          <p>Approved support contact details will be shown here before launch. Until then, <a href="/plan-your-sauna">send us a message</a> and mention that it is a care question.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section is-surface" aria-labelledby="guidance-title">
    <div class="container grid-12">
      <div class="c-4">
        <p class="label muted">Care guidance</p>
        <h2 id="guidance-title">Looking after your sauna</h2>
        <p class="muted" style="margin-top: var(--s-4)">Guidance is specific to your model and equipment, and comes from approved instructions rather than general advice.</p>
      </div>
      <dl class="c-8 facts care-list">
        {topics.map(([t, d]) => <div><dt>{t}</dt><dd><span class="sub" style="color: inherit; font-weight: 500">{d}</span><span class="pending">Published here once approved.</span></dd></div>)}
      </dl>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="equip-title">
    <div class="container grid-12">
      <div class="c-4">
        <p class="label muted">Equipment</p>
        <h2 id="equip-title">Manufacturer documentation</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="c-7 c-start-6 prose">
        <p>Heating equipment comes with its manufacturer’s own documentation, and you should follow it. We do not write safety procedures for heating equipment from general knowledge, and we link to the manufacturer’s documents once we have approved copies.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section is-surface" aria-labelledby="warranty-title">
    <div class="container grid-12">
      <div class="c-4">
        <p class="label muted">Warranty</p>
        <h2 id="warranty-title">What is covered</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="c-7 c-start-6 prose">
        <p>Warranty cover, exclusions, responsibilities and the claim process are published on the warranty page once approved. Equipment is covered under each manufacturer’s own terms.</p>
        <p><a class="text-link" href="/warranty">Warranty <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style is:global>
  .care-list dt { font-weight: 700; color: var(--fg); font-size: var(--fs-body); }
  .care-list > div { grid-template-columns: minmax(10rem, 15rem) 1fr; }
</style>
